OL,3,GNEWSA'It's kind of mental': Actor lands
OL,4,Afirst TV role in Hollyoaks
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn actor from Lincoln has landed a role
OL,7,Fin Hollyoaks.
OL,9,FIndigo Kamal-Poole, 22, made his debut
OL,10,Fappearance as newcomer Xander on the
OL,11,FChannel 4 soap opera last week.
OL,13,FIndigo, who wears hearing aids, said he
OL,14,Fsecured the role following a Hollyoaks
OL,15,Fvisible disabilities audition at the
OL,16,Fend of April.
OL,18,FReflecting on his experience so far on
OL,19,Fthe show, Indigo said: "It's so
OL,20,Fexciting all the time, very dramatic
OL,21,Fand it's definitely a bit of me."
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
